<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indeminity Corp said on Wednesday that it qualified the following three municipal bond issues, which will be sold competitively, for insurance.</p>
<p>--Oakland, Calif., $45.42 million General Obligation (GO) bonds.</p>
<p>--Spartanburg County, S.C., School District, $11.6 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Harris County, Texas, Unlimited Tax bonds $3.35 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
